<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5. Discussion ‣ The Limits of Data Scaling: Sub-token Utilization and Acoustic Saturation in Multilingual ASR" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Broader Implications for Fairness and Resource Planning</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS5" title="In 5. Discussion ‣ The Limits of Data Scaling: Sub-token Utilization and Acoustic Saturation in Multilingual ASR" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.5 </span>Future Directions</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
